00:04:11,428 --> 00:04:17,428
Love Comes Softly is a drama, romance, western
film directed by Michael Landon Jr..

2
00:08:22,857 --> 00:08:28,857
Nineteen year old pioneer woman Marty has recently married.

3
00:12:34,285 --> 00:12:40,285
She goes west with her husband Clem, hoping to start a new life.

4
00:16:45,714 --> 00:16:51,714
But Clem unexpectedly dies, and Marty finds herself alone, two months pregnant.

5
00:20:57,142 --> 00:21:03,142
Widower Clark offers her a marriage of convenience: she needs food and
money, and he needs someone to take care of his daughter Missie.

6
00:25:08,571 --> 00:25:14,571
She accepts his proposal as a temporary solution.

7
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:26,000
Marty Claridge, played by Katherine Heigl.

8
00:33:31,428 --> 00:33:37,428
Clark Davis, played by Dale Midkiff.

9
00:37:42,857 --> 00:37:48,857
Missie Davis, played by Skye McCole Bartusiak.

10
00:41:54,285 --> 00:42:00,285
Ben Graham, played by Corbin Bernsen.

11
00:46:05,714 --> 00:46:11,714
Sarah Graham, played by Theresa Russell.

12
00:50:17,142 --> 00:50:23,142
Aaron Claridge, played by Oliver Macready.

13
00:54:28,571 --> 00:54:34,571
Love Comes Softly is a 2003 made-for-television Christian drama film set in
the 19th century, based on a series of books by Janette Oke.

14
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
It originally aired on Hallmark Channel on April 13, 2003.

15
01:02:51,428 --> 01:02:57,428
It was directed by Michael Landon Jr..

16
01:07:02,857 --> 01:07:08,857
It stars Katherine Heigl as a young woman named Marty Claridge
and Dale Midkiff as a widower named Clark Davis.

17
01:11:14,285 --> 01:11:20,285
It is the first in a series of television movies made for Hallmark Channel based on
the books and produced for Hallmark by Larry Levinson Productions.

18
01:15:25,714 --> 01:15:31,714
The order of the films are the 8 originals followed by the 3 prequels:

Love Comes Softly (2003)
Love's Enduring Promise (2004)
Love's Long Journey (2005)
Love's Abiding Joy (2006)
Love's
Unending Legacy (2007)
Love's Unfolding Dream (2007)
Love Takes Wing (2009)
Love Finds a Home (2009)
Love Begins (2011)
Love's Everlasting Courage (2011)
Love's Christmas Journey (2011)

19
01:19:37,142 --> 01:19:43,142
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, widow,
